!!id:"https://tson.io/test-suite/class2/schema/invalid/an-atom-refinement-may-not-write-its-supertypes-expected.tn"
!!import:"https://tson.io/test-suite/schemas/schema-sidecar.tn"
{
  spec: "[TSON-SCHEMA] §4.1"
  description: """
    An atom refinement's chain is the resolver's too: `!int32 ^ { ... }` already makes `age` IS-A
    `int32`, and a binding naming the chain is a claim no refinement makes, refused as a binding of a
    facet the constructor does not offer would be.
    """
  error: {
    category: resolver
  }
}
